<body>
    <h1>RabbitMQ IRIS Integration Testing</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h2 id=3D"RabbitMQIRISIntegrationTesting-TranscribeSummarizeTesting=
">Transcribe Summarize Testing</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Jul 18, 2025: Erik was able to successfully connect to the RMQ server. H=
e=E2=80=99s going to update the aipluscommon module which T&amp;S (and Noti=
fication API) need to be rebuilt with to properly connect: <span class=3D"c=
onfluence-jim-macro jira-issue resolved" data-jira-key=3D"AI-812"> <a href=
=3D"https://perifery.atlassian.net/browse/AI-812" class=3D"jira-issue-key">=
<img class=3D"icon" src=3D"https://perifery.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/univer=
sal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=3Dmedium">AI-812</a> - <sp=
an class=3D"summary">RabbitMQ does not pass the correct SSL connection cont=
ext</span> <span class=3D"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-succes=
s jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf">Done</span> </span></p></li>
<li>
<p>Jul 19, 2025: <a class=3D"confluence-userlink user-mention" data-account=
-id=3D"712020:24328ab5-a766-4724-bd74-fe21ffe69928" href=3D"https://perifer=
y.atlassian.net/wiki/people/712020:24328ab5-a766-4724-bd74-fe21ffe69928?ref=
