f4-40c6-bef5-2f6079ec3be5" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"252"></span><=
/li>
<li>
<p><a class=3D"external-link" data-card-appearance=3D"inline" href=3D"https=
://github.com/workflow-intelligence-nexus/TranscribeSummarize/pull/28" rel=
