294049809" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"=
userinfo" data-base-url=3D"https://perifery.atlassian.net/wiki">Jamie Sabin=
o</a> just needs to fix the build, re-deploy the image to Lambda 1, and we=
=E2=80=99ll confirm everything looks good there as well.</p></li>
<li>
<p>This PR also fixes this bug: <span class=3D"confluence-jim-macro jira-is=
sue resolved" data-jira-key=3D"AI-813"> <a href=3D"https://perifery.atlassi=
an.net/browse/AI-813" class=3D"jira-issue-key"><img class=3D"icon" src=3D"h=
ttps://perifery.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuety=
pe/avatar/10303?size=3Dmedium">AI-813</a> - <span class=3D"summary">Transcr=
ibeSummarize R1 Bug - Consul showing 2 different services for T&amp;S, Rabb=
itMq connection issue</span> <span class=3D"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle =
aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf">Done</span> </span>=
</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Jul 20, 2025: Gareth requested changes to the data payload format, track=
ed by this ticket: <span class=3D"confluence-jim-macro jira-issue resolved"=
 data-jira-key=3D"AI-815"> <a href=3D"https://perifery.atlassian.net/browse=
/AI-815" class=3D"jira-issue-key"><img class=3D"icon" src=3D"https://perife=
ry.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/103=
03?size=3Dmedium">AI-815</a> - <span class=3D"summary">TranscribeSummarize =
R1 Bug - Need to align message data to Vision exchange</span> <span class=
=3D"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-is=
sue-export-pdf">Done</span> </span></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><a class=3D"confluence-userlink user-mention" data-account-id=3D"712020:=
24328ab5-a766-4724-bd74-fe21ffe69928" href=3D"https://perifery.atlassian.ne=
t/wiki/people/712020:24328ab5-a766-4724-bd74-fe21ffe69928?ref=3Dconfluence"=
 target=3D"_blank" data-linked-resource-id=3D"4305256465" data-linked-resou=
rce-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"userinfo" data-base-url=3D"h=
ttps://perifery.atlassian.net/wiki">Justin Toribio</a> made the changes, pu=
blished another test job to the vision exchange and asked Gareth to review.=
 If he gives the thumbs up, I will create the PR. I need to fix the unit te=
sts due to the changes.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"RabbitMQIRISIntegrationTesting-NotificationAPITesting">Notificati=
on API Testing</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Jul 20, 2025: <a class=3D"confluence-userlink user-mention" data-account=
-id=3D"712020:224068bd-1695-42a9-8521-cb15b95812f4" href=3D"https://perifer=
y.atlassian.net/wiki/people/712020:224068bd-1695-42a9-8521-cb15b95812f4?ref=
=3Dconfluence" target=3D"_blank" data-base-url=3D"https://perifery.atlassia=
n.net/wiki">Bedri Bahru (Unlicensed)</a> updated aipluscommon version on No=
tificationAPI and was able to connect, consume a =E2=80=9CFileCreated=E2=80=
=9C event message and successfully trigger T&amp;S with the correct structu=
re and payload. Tested on both local (no TLS) and node 1/ftl-dev-sn-01(TLS)=
 RMQ servers.</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>update the T&amp;S payload to include <strong>tenant_id</strong></p></li=
>
<li>
<p>PR: <a class=3D"external-link" data-card-appearance=3D"inline" href=3D"h=
ttps://github.com/StartupAgile-WIN/NotificationAPI/pull/45" rel=3D"nofollow=
">https://github.com/StartupAgile-WIN/NotificationAPI/pull/45</a> (Approved=
/Merged)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Jul 21, 2025: NotificationAPI Deployment and Verification on <code>lambd=
a1</code></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Configuration Verification</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Verified that <strong>Iris</strong> was enabled via <strong>ConfigGUI / =
Consul</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Confirmed <strong>T&amp;S</strong> was correctly configured via <strong>=
ConfigGUI / Consul</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Updated <strong>RabbitMQ configurations</strong> in <strong>Consul</stro=
ng>:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Set correct <strong>endpoint</strong> and <strong>credentials</strong> (=
host, username, password).</p></li>
<li>
<p>Specified valid <strong>TLS certificate paths</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Configured <code>queues/processing/name_template</code> under <strong>na=
me_template</strong>.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Container and Connectivity</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Verified that <strong>TLS certificate paths</strong> were properly mount=
ed to the <strong>NotificationAPI</strong> container.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Confirmed that <strong>NotificationAPI</strong> successfully connected t=
o <strong>RabbitMQ</strong>.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>T&amp;S Registration and Event Processing</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Registered a folder with <strong>T&amp;S</strong> as the processor, alon=
g with the default processing config using the <strong>IrisBucket</strong> =
object via <strong>NotificationAPI Swagger</strong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Dropped an audio/video file into the configured <strong>bucket folder</s=
trong>.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Verified that a <strong>FileCreated</strong> event was successfully proc=
essed.</p></li>
<li>
<p>Confirmed that the correct <strong>payload</strong> (event info and proc=
essing config) was sent to <strong>T&amp;S</strong>.</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
<li>
<p>Jul 22, 2025: A new bug ( <span class=3D"confluence-jim-macro jira-issue=
 resolved" data-jira-key=3D"AI-838"> <a href=3D"https://perifery.atlassian.=
net/browse/AI-838" class=3D"jira-issue-key"><img class=3D"icon" src=3D"http=
s://perifery.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/=
avatar/10303?size=3Dmedium">AI-838</a> - <span class=3D"summary">Notificati=
on API - Configured Buckets not Working as expected.</span> <span class=3D"=
aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-=
export-pdf">Done</span> </span> ) was discovered when configuring and testi=
ng the bucket/space root (space01/) and dropping files in subfolders.</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Further testing revealed the issue is specific to the root folder and th=
e config inheritance process works on configured folders and subfolders</p>=
</li>
<li>
<p><a class=3D"confluence-userlink user-mention" data-account-id=3D"712020:=
224068bd-1695-42a9-8521-cb15b95812f4" href=3D"https://perifery.atlassian.ne=
t/wiki/people/712020:224068bd-1695-42a9-8521-cb15b95812f4?ref=3Dconfluence"=
 target=3D"_blank" data-base-url=3D"https://perifery.atlassian.net/wiki">Be=
dri Bahru (Unlicensed)</a> Verified the bug on lambda2, made the changes to=
 fix the bug and tested and verified the bug is fixed</p>
<ul>
<li>
<p>PR: <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://github.com/workflow-intel=
ligence-nexus/NotificationAPI/pull/48" rel=3D"nofollow">Pull 48</a> (Merged=
)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p></p>
<p></p>
    </div>
</body>
